usb: gadget: f_fs: don't hang unbind after an interrupted read

Killing adbd mid-read left ep->context set, so ffs_epfile_io_wait waited
forever on io_finished and the gadget unbind (and reboot) hung.

--- a/drivers/usb/gadget/function/f_fs.c
+++ b/drivers/usb/gadget/function/f_fs.c
@@ -1112,6 +1112,8 @@
 
 		if (interrupted) {
 			ret = -EINTR;
+			/* finished: don't leave ffs_epfile_io_wait waiting for it */
+			ep->context = NULL;
 		} else if (io_data->read && ep->status > 0) {
 			ret = __ffs_epfile_read_data(epfile, data, ep->status,
 						     &io_data->data);
